{"seq":2,"slug":"models","title":"经典模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mm1-queue","title":"M/M/1 队列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/models/mm1-queue","wordCount":1257,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"mmc-multiserver","title":"M/M/c 多服务台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/models/mmc-multiserver","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"mg1-general-service","title":"M/G/1 与一般服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/queueing-theory/models/mg1-general-service","wordCount":1448,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"经典模型\">经典模型</h1><p>有了要素、记号和 Little 定律，这一章把它们落到三个能真正算出数字的具体系统，覆盖了排队论实战中约八成的场景。三个模型按「假设逐步放松」的顺序排列，每放松一步，就暴露出一个新的工程洞见。</p>\n<p>「M/M/1 队列」是最干净的起点：到达泊松、服务指数、单台服务器，用生灭过程能解出队长分布、平均延迟与利用率的全套闭式公式，并第一次让你看到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho\\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时延迟如何爆炸。「M/M/c 多服务台」把单台推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 台共享一个队列，引出 Erlang C 公式与等待概率，回答呼叫中心与服务器集群最关心的「该配几个坐席」，并揭示多台合并排队为何远优于各排各的。「M/G/1 与一般服务」放弃服务时间必须指数的假设，用 Pollaczek–Khinchine 公式点破一个反直觉的事实：在相同平均服务时间下，<strong>服务时间的方差</strong>才是决定排队延迟的主因——这解释了为什么减少长尾任务比单纯提速更有效。</p>\n<p>建议严格按 M/M/1 → M/M/c → M/G/1 顺序读，后者都建立在前者的推导框架上。本章的所有指标都满足上一章的 Little 定律，可随时回查验算。读完这三个模型，你就具备了把它们串成网络（下一章）的全部单点能力。</p>\n"}